{"id":"ekhat_","lemma":"ехать","pos":"verb","rank":530,"glosses":["to go (by horse or vehicle), to ride, to drive","to travel","to move from a place, to slide off"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/6/64/Ru-%D0%B5%D1%85%D0%B0%D1%82%D1%8C.ogg/Ru-%D0%B5%D1%85%D0%B0%D1%82%D1%8C.ogg.mp3","conjugation":{"indicative":{"present":{"1s":"еду","2s":"едешь","3s":"едет","1p":"едем","2p":"едете","3p":"едут"},"future":{"1s":"буду ехать","2s":"будешь ехать","3s":"будет ехать","1p":"будем ехать","2p":"будете ехать","3p":"будут ехать"}},"imperative":{"affirmative":{"2s":"поезжай","2p":"поезжайте"}}},"past":{"m":"ехал","p":"ехали","f":"ехала","n":"ехало"},"aspect":"imperfective","aspectPartner":"поехать","examples":[{"text":"Я боюсь туда ехать.","en":"I'm afraid to go there.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1274699","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to fear, to be afraid","l":"бояться"},{"g":"there"},null]},{"text":"Завтра я еду домой.","en":"I'm going home tomorrow.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1270253","words":[{"g":"tomorrow"},{"g":"I"},null,{"g":"home"}]},{"text":"Скажи мне, пожалуйста, куда мы едем.","en":"Please tell me where we're going.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/738505","words":[{"g":"to say, to tell","l":"сказать"},{"g":"(to) me","l":"я"},{"g":"please"},{"g":"where?"},{"g":"we"},null]},{"text":"Том знает, почему он едет сюда?","en":"Does Tom know why he's coming here?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/738408","words":[{"g":"that one, those ones","l":"тот"},{"g":"to know: to be familiar…","l":"знать"},{"g":"why"},{"g":"he / it"},null,{"g":"here, hither"}]},{"text":"Почему ты едешь?","en":"Why are you going?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/738467","words":[{"g":"why"},{"g":"you"},null]}]}